<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ vehicle registrations fell 18.2 pct in June mth.</title>
<headline>NZ vehicle registrations fell 18.2 pct in June mth.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The total number of vehicle registrations in New Zealand fell 18.2 percent in June to 16,839 from 20,587 in May, the Land Transport Safety Authority said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Registrations in June 1996 totalled 18,470.</p>
<p>Registrations of new and ex-overseas vehicles totalled 15,712 in June versus 19,107 in May and 17,381 in June 1996.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 473-4746</p>
</text>
